### Pull Request: Fix race condition in TokenCache (#432)

**Description**
The recent refactor introduced a race condition where concurrent requests could overwrite cached tokens, leading to intermittent authentication failures. This PR adds locking around cache reads/writes and updates the token eviction policy.

**Changes**
```diff
@@
 class TokenCache {
-    private Map<String, Token> cache = new HashMap<>();
+    private final ConcurrentHashMap<String, Token> cache = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
+    private final ReentrantLock lock = new ReentrantLock();

     public Token getToken(String userId) {
-        return cache.get(userId);
+        lock.lock();
+        try {
+            return cache.get(userId);
+        } finally {
+            lock.unlock();
+        }
     }

     public void putToken(String userId, Token token) {
-        cache.put(userId, token);
+        lock.lock();
+        try {
+            cache.put(userId, token);
+        } finally {
+            lock.unlock();
+        }
     }
 }
```

