## Pull Request: Fix memory leak in `DataProcessor` (#452)

### Description
This PR addresses a memory leak issue identified in the `DataProcessor` class when handling large CSV imports. The leak was caused by not properly closing file streams and retaining references to intermediate buffers.

### Changes
- Updated `src/main/java/com/example/DataProcessor.java`:
  ```java
@@
-    BufferedReader reader = new BufferedReader(new FileReader(filePath));
-    List<String[]> rows = new ArrayList<>();
